            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 165,
        "ActionId": 166,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "\"The Emperor\"",
            "In the world I yearn for, you will not exist.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 166,
        "ActionId": 167,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "\"The Emperor\"",
            "In the \"civilization\" you yearn for... I will not exist either.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 167,
        "ActionId": 168,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "\"The Emperor\"",
            "We are just using each other now.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 168,
        "ActionId": 169,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Cradle",
            "Use, as in human stories, is also a form of game.",
            1
