    },
    {
        "Id": 174,
        "ActionId": 175,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "\"The Emperor\"",
            "When that time comes, you will not see me like this.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 175,
        "ActionId": 176,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Cradle",
            "Conflict between civilizations is also a \"pattern\" of civilization.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 176,
        "ActionId": 177,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
